WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:04.530
And then...

00:04.530 --> 00:05.980
Yes?

00:04.530 --> 00:05.980
Welcome!

00:07.330 --> 00:08.990
L-Lady Saint?

00:10.100 --> 00:12.420
There's someone dazzling here at the cafe!

01:43.240 --> 01:47.000
Episode 6

01:43.240 --> 01:47.000
Abel and Hazelita

01:47.360 --> 01:50.250
Is it really all right 
for me to ask for your help?

01:50.250 --> 01:53.130
No matter how short-staffed I might be, 
asking the lady saint to do this...

01:53.130 --> 01:55.830
Those in difficulty must be aided.

01:55.830 --> 01:59.000
Regardless, while Lawren 
is finishing his errand,

01:59.000 --> 02:00.960
I'm simply waiting for him.

02:04.600 --> 02:05.700
<i>Thank you!</i>

02:05.700 --> 02:06.750
<i>Excuse me!</i>

02:06.750 --> 02:08.100
<i>Coming!</i>

02:08.740 --> 02:10.200
<i>Sorry to keep you waiting.</i>

02:10.200 --> 02:11.360
<i>Excuse me!</i>

02:11.360 --> 02:12.590
<i>Just a moment, please!</i>

02:13.110 --> 02:16.240
It makes me very happy to be helpful!

02:16.240 --> 02:17.950
Lady Saint.

02:17.950 --> 02:20.360
Then, I'll go ahead 
and take you at your word.

02:21.120 --> 02:23.640
Could you carry this parfait out for me?

02:24.870 --> 02:26.750
It's so sparkly! It's beautiful!

02:26.750 --> 02:29.350
Lawrence hasn't made any for you?

02:29.350 --> 02:31.880
This is the first time 
I've seen a... is it called a parfait?

02:31.880 --> 02:36.630
The ability to make beautiful food 
is like magic to me!

02:36.630 --> 02:38.890
You're amazing, Miss Kelly!

02:40.760 --> 02:42.440
Thank you for waiting.

02:43.640 --> 02:47.270
Lady Saint, why are you working here?

02:47.270 --> 02:49.880
I'm simply helping out a little, that's all.

02:49.880 --> 02:52.960
Working in the village is very nice.

02:52.960 --> 02:55.900
It allows me to get a sense 
of how everyone lives firsthand.

02:55.900 --> 02:57.270
I felt like, as a lady saint,

02:57.270 --> 03:00.990
that's something I need to know more about.

03:00.990 --> 03:03.990
L-Lady Saint.

03:03.990 --> 03:08.500
<i>Plus, I want Lawren 
to praise me for helping!</i>

03:10.110 --> 03:11.310
Lady Saint!

03:11.310 --> 03:13.240
Is it true that you have a part-time job?!

03:13.240 --> 03:15.000
Lawren!

03:16.010 --> 03:19.240
Has the uniform here always been that fancy?

03:19.240 --> 03:21.360
It's just the same as before.

03:21.260 --> 03:22.760
Sees things through a filter.

03:22.760 --> 03:24.940
Lawren, I'm sorry.

03:24.940 --> 03:28.140
They seemed to be in trouble 
because they were short-handed.

03:28.140 --> 03:32.390
I'm not angry. I was just worried.

03:33.640 --> 03:36.650
Lady Saint, how much do 
we owe for broken dishes?

03:36.650 --> 03:38.690
I haven't broken a single one!

03:38.690 --> 03:40.360
What? Not even one?

03:41.650 --> 03:42.990
Well...

03:42.990 --> 03:44.610
You've been trying your 
very best, haven't you?

03:44.610 --> 03:45.800
Incredible!

03:46.980 --> 03:49.800
<i>Lawren complimented me!</i>

03:51.760 --> 03:53.290
Welcome!

03:53.550 --> 03:57.120
I'd like to help until things 
calm down a little, but...

03:57.120 --> 03:58.400
I understand.

03:59.170 --> 04:00.960
Thank you!

04:02.490 --> 04:04.310
Mister Pastor!

04:05.350 --> 04:07.890
Miss Mell! You're here.

04:07.890 --> 04:10.750
If you're worried, I wouldn't 
mind sharing a table with you.

04:10.750 --> 04:12.640
Thank you, I'll do that.

04:13.310 --> 04:15.120
Would you mind switching seats with me?

04:15.120 --> 04:17.640
It would be easier to watch 
over the lady saint from there.

04:17.640 --> 04:18.900
It's like an illness with you.

04:19.630 --> 04:22.900
I never imagined that the lady 
saint would work waiting tables.

04:22.900 --> 04:25.450
She seems to like interacting with people,

04:25.450 --> 04:28.660
so this might suit her 
more than you'd expect.

04:28.660 --> 04:32.350
I'm sorry to have 
the lady saint help me here.

04:32.350 --> 04:33.120
Not at all.

04:33.120 --> 04:35.210
And the lady saint seems 
to be enjoying herself.

04:35.650 --> 04:39.290
A little while ago, she was very excited, 
saying, "I've never seen a parfait before!"

04:39.620 --> 04:40.880
Maybe I'll make some soon.

04:40.880 --> 04:42.800
You could also eat them here.

04:43.080 --> 04:45.500
You seem really busy today.

04:45.500 --> 04:46.630
We are!

04:46.630 --> 04:49.520
My help suddenly took some time off.

04:49.520 --> 04:52.680
That's why I'm having 
the lady saint help me,

04:52.680 --> 04:55.200
but, maybe because
we have the lady saint here,

04:55.200 --> 04:56.750
we have even more customers than usual,

04:56.750 --> 04:58.800
so we're still very short-staffed.

04:58.800 --> 05:00.190
I see.

05:00.900 --> 05:04.160
We're still very short-handed.

05:04.160 --> 05:04.960
What?

05:08.320 --> 05:09.780
Welcome!

05:10.960 --> 05:13.460
Looks like the impact was 
a little too strong for you, huh?

05:13.880 --> 05:17.720
He's usually so dense 
that it's easy to forget,

05:17.720 --> 05:19.970
but his specs are pretty high.

05:19.970 --> 05:22.630
Lawren is always high-spec!

05:22.920 --> 05:25.020
Lady Saint, could you please take this?

05:25.020 --> 05:26.380
Coming!

05:28.380 --> 05:30.570
Lady Saint, are you all right with that?

05:30.570 --> 05:32.760
No need to worry!

05:32.760 --> 05:34.690
<i>Lawren is watching.</i>

05:34.690 --> 05:37.260
<i>I have to make sure to do my job well!</i>

05:40.090 --> 05:41.400
Lawren?

05:41.400 --> 05:44.270
This is just as precarious 
as I was worried it would be!

05:44.270 --> 05:46.610
I-I'm so sorry!

05:46.610 --> 05:50.610
When you're around, Lawren, 
I tend to relax too much.

05:50.610 --> 05:52.290
When I'm around?

05:52.290 --> 05:54.200
When you're nearby,

05:54.200 --> 05:58.000
I feel comfortable and it makes me 
want to sprawl over the sofa!

05:58.000 --> 06:01.210
Just be honest and say 
that you want to laze around.

06:03.420 --> 06:06.720
I never imagined that you'd 
do part-time work, Lady Saint.

06:06.720 --> 06:10.830
It made me happy to be able to speak with 
people I don't normally get a chance to see.

06:10.830 --> 06:14.720
The lady who lent me an umbrella 
that one time was even there!

06:14.720 --> 06:16.950
I'm impressed that you 
remember what she looked like.

06:16.950 --> 06:19.720
Well, I'm good at remembering faces.

06:19.720 --> 06:22.560
That isn't something that everyone can do.

06:22.560 --> 06:24.280
It's a very impressive skill.

06:25.410 --> 06:28.280
You're complimenting me a lot today, Lawren.

06:28.280 --> 06:31.750
Maybe I'll ask if I can work 
as a waitress again.

06:32.880 --> 06:35.030
<i>She's going to dress like that again?</i>

06:35.450 --> 06:37.520
<i>It's pretty, so it looks nice on her,</i>

06:37.520 --> 06:39.720
<i>but it makes her stand out so much!</i>

06:39.720 --> 06:41.340
Lawren?

06:42.130 --> 06:43.620
Should I not?

06:46.460 --> 06:49.630
You shouldn't if I'm not there.

06:49.630 --> 06:52.870
B-But if you're there, 
I'll relax and the dishes will...

06:52.870 --> 06:54.800
You're worried about the dishes?

06:56.350 --> 06:59.600
Immediately made some.

07:01.110 --> 07:05.110
They said they need men down 
in the village, so we're going.

07:05.110 --> 07:08.440
Miss Hazelita, please look 
after the lady saint.

07:08.440 --> 07:09.970
I will.

07:17.870 --> 07:21.000
<i>Is she planning to wait like 
that for him to come back?</i>

07:21.000 --> 07:23.950
You'll catch a cold sitting 
in a place like that.

07:24.710 --> 07:27.590
Here. You should go take a bath.

07:28.750 --> 07:33.590
<i>So when Lawrence leaves her behind, 
she becomes this dispirited.</i>

07:35.600 --> 07:37.840
<i>I have to stay behind today.</i>

07:38.160 --> 07:39.860
<i>Now that I think about it,</i>

07:39.860 --> 07:43.730
<i>this is the first time it's been just me 
and Hazelita, isn't it?</i>

07:43.730 --> 07:49.480
<i>And it's the first time I've spent time 
alone with someone my own age.</i>

07:50.490 --> 07:53.240
<i>Oh, now I can't stop thinking about it!</i>

07:53.510 --> 07:56.480
Stay warm while you sleep tonight.

07:56.480 --> 07:57.920
Good night.

07:58.180 --> 07:59.520
Um...

08:00.560 --> 08:02.780
W-Would you like to stay up late tonight?

08:02.780 --> 08:04.780
<i>What kind of wayward invitation is this?</i>

08:04.780 --> 08:09.040
<i>Lawrence asked me to look after Cecilia.</i>

08:09.040 --> 08:11.720
<i>I have to act responsibly.</i>

08:11.590 --> 08:12.300
The Responsible
One

08:12.300 --> 08:15.900
If you wait up late, you're going
 to end up making him worry.

08:15.910 --> 08:17.520
That's true...

08:17.520 --> 08:21.840
but I thought it would give me the chance 
to talk with you, Hazelita.

08:22.760 --> 08:26.180
Well, there's no helping it, then! 
But just for a little while, all right?

08:26.180 --> 08:27.640
You don't mind?

08:28.000 --> 08:30.520
Then, please come to my room!

08:30.520 --> 08:32.430
Thank you for having me.

08:33.190 --> 08:35.780
<i>It's more plain than I expected.</i>

08:35.780 --> 08:38.440
Does Lawrence come in here?

08:38.440 --> 08:39.290
Yes.

08:39.290 --> 08:41.290
He comes to wake me up every morning!

08:41.290 --> 08:44.630
<i>Their relationship is already 
sort of like parent and child.</i>

08:44.630 --> 08:48.400
<i>I mean, it just isn't right 
to enter a girl's room so casually.</i>

08:48.400 --> 08:53.130
<i>But could it be that the problem is the 
fact that she isn't bothered by it?</i>

08:53.520 --> 08:57.010
Cecilia, let's make your room cuter.

08:57.010 --> 08:58.260
All right...

08:58.260 --> 09:00.640
And you should choose a different nightgown!

09:00.640 --> 09:04.010
I couldn't possibly wear 
such a revealing nightgown!

09:04.010 --> 09:07.260
If Lawren saw me wearing 
something like that...

09:08.480 --> 09:10.270
Cecilia...

09:10.270 --> 09:12.370
you love Lawrence, don't you?

09:12.370 --> 09:13.370
Lo—?!

09:13.370 --> 09:14.290
In that case,

09:14.290 --> 09:17.820
you have to make him more aware of the 
fact that you're a woman and he's a man!

09:17.820 --> 09:21.040
Right now, you're more like 
a mother and child.

09:21.040 --> 09:22.620
He's like my mother?

09:22.620 --> 09:24.540
B-But that's...

09:24.540 --> 09:28.700
I like the space Lawren 
and I have between us right now.

09:28.700 --> 09:29.880
I see.

09:29.880 --> 09:34.680
So, was the story I heard about 
Cecilia staring at a wedding dress true?

09:35.460 --> 09:37.610
Th-That's for some time in the future!

09:37.610 --> 09:38.960
The future, huh?

09:38.960 --> 09:42.660
Honestly! Why are you 
pressuring me like this?

09:44.850 --> 09:46.140
It is, of course,

09:46.140 --> 09:50.860
because I want every lady saint 
to find happiness as a woman, too.

09:51.230 --> 09:54.520
They carry the duty to make others happy,

09:54.520 --> 09:57.660
but can't find happiness themselves.

09:57.660 --> 10:00.480
It's a horrible situation.

10:01.820 --> 10:06.040
The people around her treated 
her like she transcended humanity.

10:06.040 --> 10:09.370
She died of a disease that could 
have been cured if she'd seen a doctor.

10:09.680 --> 10:13.910
In other words, lady saints are just humans.

10:13.910 --> 10:16.310
<i>She was the lady's friend.</i>

10:18.760 --> 10:20.120
Don't worry.

10:21.030 --> 10:24.180
If nothing else, I'm happy right now.

10:24.180 --> 10:26.040
I get to live with Lawren.

10:26.040 --> 10:27.740
Abel came to have fun.

10:27.740 --> 10:30.400
All the villagers are so nice.

10:30.400 --> 10:34.080
And... I've gotten to be 
friends with you, Hazelita.

10:34.750 --> 10:39.700
I'm certain that you've previously made 
others happy just by being with them.

10:40.950 --> 10:44.280
Honestly accepting warmth 
from people is something

10:44.280 --> 10:46.570
that lady saints are very good at.

10:49.000 --> 10:53.090
It's easy to see that, looking at you.

10:53.670 --> 10:58.290
It would be nice if all the lady saints 
in the world could be like you.

10:58.290 --> 11:01.090
Taking it easy every day.

11:01.550 --> 11:03.000
Um...

11:03.000 --> 11:04.580
Out in the world,

11:04.580 --> 11:08.850
I've heard that women will get together 
like this to drink tea and chat!

11:08.850 --> 11:10.240
What do they talk about?

11:10.240 --> 11:15.180
If I remember correctly, 
they talk about husbands and sweethearts!

11:15.180 --> 11:16.800
We did that just now, didn't we?

11:16.800 --> 11:18.320
We did not!

11:18.320 --> 11:21.670
Hazelita, don't you have anything 
to say on the topic?

11:21.670 --> 11:22.790
Me?

11:22.790 --> 11:24.700
Do I look like I do?

11:24.700 --> 11:27.280
Wh-Why do your eyes look so distant?

11:27.280 --> 11:30.800
Isn't Abel that sort of person 
to you, Hazelita?

11:30.800 --> 11:33.280
He's just a poor excuse for a tutor.

11:33.280 --> 11:34.460
A poor...

11:34.460 --> 11:37.960
It's true that he acts 
unconventionally at times,

11:37.960 --> 11:39.840
but when it comes down to it, 
he's very perceptive,

11:39.840 --> 11:44.480
and the reason he calls me by name 
is out of consideration for you, isn't it?

11:45.260 --> 11:49.800
But he doesn't treat me like a woman.

11:52.020 --> 11:53.740
Did you catch a cold or something?

11:53.740 --> 11:55.440
Pastors!

11:56.090 --> 11:59.440
Thank you for coming 
to help look for my son.

11:59.440 --> 12:01.600
Not at all. We're glad he's safe.

12:01.600 --> 12:04.410
That's thanks to Pastor Abel 
for finding him!

12:04.410 --> 12:06.490
I'm used to finding lost children.

12:06.490 --> 12:08.480
Where am I?

12:10.080 --> 12:15.290
Abel, you do a lot for Miss Hazelita 
outside of your duties as a tutor, don't you?

12:15.290 --> 12:18.040
The lady's family asked me to.

12:18.040 --> 12:21.300
She's always so straight-forward, 
it tends to put her in precarious situations.

12:21.300 --> 12:23.440
She's basically a wild boar.

12:23.440 --> 12:25.680
I'm not sure about that metaphor.

12:25.680 --> 12:26.740
What about you?

12:26.740 --> 12:30.500
Aren't you worried leaving Saint Cecilia 
and the lady alone together?

12:30.500 --> 12:32.210
I'm sure they'll be fine.

12:32.210 --> 12:34.930
After all, the lady saint 
has been wanting friends.

12:34.930 --> 12:39.600
And interacting with the lady saint will be 
good for Miss Hazelita, don't you think?

12:40.690 --> 12:42.470
That's true.

12:45.950 --> 12:52.210
<i>This girl knows what happiness 
is, not as a lady saint but as a person.</i>

12:52.530 --> 12:56.960
<i>And it was Lawrence and the people 
of this village who made sure of that.</i>

12:56.960 --> 13:00.960
<i>Cecilia is walking a path 
that she never could.</i>

13:01.710 --> 13:07.080
<i>I'd like to watch and see 
if she continues to live this happily.</i>

13:08.870 --> 13:10.130
Oh, they're bac—

13:15.440 --> 13:17.440
Lawren! Welcome home!

13:17.440 --> 13:20.190
Lady Saint, you didn't go to sleep?

13:22.190 --> 13:24.710
What are you laughing about, Miss?

13:24.710 --> 13:26.080
I mean, it's just...

13:26.080 --> 13:29.290
Cecilia suddenly jumped up and rushed out.

13:29.290 --> 13:30.960
She's just like a loyal hound.

13:30.960 --> 13:32.530
Hazelita!

13:32.530 --> 13:34.600
I think the lady saint 
is more of a rabbit than a hound.

13:34.600 --> 13:35.830
Not you, too, Lawren.

13:35.830 --> 13:38.550
I'm not a dog or a rabbit!

13:38.800 --> 13:41.930
Then, if Lawrence were 
an animal, what would he be?

13:41.930 --> 13:42.750
What?

13:43.200 --> 13:45.240
Perhaps... a bear?

13:45.240 --> 13:48.050
Because he's so warm and reliable.

13:48.050 --> 13:49.490
You've focused on some 
very important points.

13:49.490 --> 13:50.940
You think so?

13:50.940 --> 13:52.680
Then, Abel would be...

13:52.680 --> 13:54.200
Maybe a fox?

13:54.200 --> 13:55.600
A fox?

14:00.020 --> 14:02.940
Rabbit and bear.

14:00.360 --> 14:01.660
Here you go.

14:03.200 --> 14:06.100
The lady is charging 
straight ahead as usual today.

14:03.690 --> 14:06.950
Boar and fox.

14:10.690 --> 14:12.370
<i>Ever since I was very young,</i>

14:12.750 --> 14:15.040
<i>I've been able to see things 
other people couldn't.</i>

14:15.630 --> 14:18.690
<i>I was a little different from normal people, 
and when they looked at me...</i>

14:18.690 --> 14:22.630
<i>my parents, friends, 
everyone, found me creepy.</i>

14:22.930 --> 14:27.100
<i>One day, I was told, "Don't come back," 
and kicked out of the dorm.</i>

14:27.860 --> 14:31.130
<i>I'd already learned what 
it was to be alone in my life.</i>

14:31.410 --> 14:34.630
<i>I was certain that 
I'd continue in darkness forever.</i>

14:35.560 --> 14:37.780
<i>But that...</i>

14:38.520 --> 14:43.380
<i>was what would've happened if I hadn't met 
a certain someone who changed me.</i>

14:53.400 --> 14:55.040
Oh.

14:55.040 --> 14:58.050
That dream was because of those pictures.

15:00.040 --> 15:02.200
Good morning, Abel!

15:02.200 --> 15:04.760
Good morning, Saint Cecilia.

15:04.760 --> 15:06.170
Here you go.

15:06.170 --> 15:10.650
The pictures I promised you before, 
from when Lawrence was in school.

15:11.550 --> 15:14.520
I asked an associate in the town 
to the west to send them for me.

15:14.520 --> 15:17.950
Thank you so much! 
I'll look at them right now!

15:17.950 --> 15:19.400
Please do!

15:19.400 --> 15:21.880
Oh, I'm in them, too.

15:22.220 --> 15:23.570
I guess it doesn't matter.

15:23.890 --> 15:25.650
Hazelita!

15:26.480 --> 15:28.400
Look at that grin.

15:28.400 --> 15:30.180
It must be about Lawrence, right?

15:30.180 --> 15:31.900
How did you know?

15:31.900 --> 15:36.170
Abel brought me pictures of Lawrence from 
when they were in school!

15:36.170 --> 15:37.910
Shall we look at them together?

15:37.910 --> 15:39.410
<b>A few minutes later...</b>

15:39.410 --> 15:41.210
This amount is lethal...

15:41.210 --> 15:42.660
This amount is lethal?

15:42.660 --> 15:47.220
I must burn them into my memory.

15:47.540 --> 15:51.320
Lawrence looks like he was 
a lot more lively back then.

15:51.320 --> 15:53.480
I'm sure he was a good boy.

15:53.480 --> 15:55.650
They look like they're 
having fun in every photo.

15:55.650 --> 15:59.040
Lawren is so cheerful, both then and now.

15:59.040 --> 16:01.760
I wonder if his denseness started back then.

16:02.810 --> 16:05.010
Is Abel in any of these?

16:05.010 --> 16:08.680
Given the way he is, he seems like 
the type to try to stand out.

16:08.680 --> 16:10.890
Could this be him?

16:13.690 --> 16:15.950
<i>He isn't smiling at all.</i>

16:15.950 --> 16:18.930
He's completely the opposite 
of Lawren and all his smiles.

16:18.930 --> 16:22.700
He also seems opposite 
from the way he is right now.

16:22.700 --> 16:24.960
What are the two of you looking at?

16:26.580 --> 16:28.840
Why are you both so startled?

16:29.610 --> 16:31.340
What is all of this?!

16:31.340 --> 16:34.090
Retrieving

16:32.430 --> 16:34.090
Lady Saint!

16:34.360 --> 16:37.370
Lawrence, this is Abel, isn't it?

16:38.320 --> 16:41.200
Did he really look this expressionless?

16:41.200 --> 16:44.020
He gives a slightly different 
impression there than he does now.

16:44.020 --> 16:48.370
Thinking back on it, he was 
a lot calmer then than he is now.

16:48.370 --> 16:50.760
In the beginning, he hardly ever spoke.

16:50.760 --> 16:54.510
Well, he's probably like that because 
he isn't living with his parents.

16:54.510 --> 16:56.780
So, you know about that, Miss Hazelita?

16:56.780 --> 16:59.640
Well, I do have him working as my tutor.

16:59.640 --> 17:01.710
Did he run away from home?

17:01.710 --> 17:05.690
No, Abel didn't chose to leave them.

17:05.690 --> 17:07.360
It's very sad.

17:08.340 --> 17:10.440
I'm sorry for not saying anything.

17:10.440 --> 17:13.640
I've always been able to 
see all sorts of things.

17:13.640 --> 17:16.510
<i>Since Abel has been able to 
see things since he was a child,</i>

17:16.510 --> 17:21.000
<i>could this mean that the people 
around him didn't accept him?</i>

17:22.960 --> 17:24.890
Pastor Abel!

17:26.490 --> 17:27.780
Hi.

17:27.780 --> 17:28.960
See you later!

17:36.650 --> 17:40.490
Lawren, how did you and Abel become close?

17:40.490 --> 17:43.650
There was a class at school 
where we had to form pairs.

17:43.650 --> 17:47.090
Abel was alone, so I asked him. 
I think that was the start of it.

17:47.090 --> 17:49.620
At the beginning, he was curt with me,

17:49.620 --> 17:51.780
but somehow that made me feel upset,

17:51.780 --> 17:55.210
so I kept trying to talk to him, 
and we ended up friends along the way.

17:55.210 --> 17:57.320
But we became really close when...

17:57.610 --> 17:59.060
Abel!

18:01.970 --> 18:03.460
Ow...

18:03.460 --> 18:06.080
Suddenly... my head really hurts...

18:07.030 --> 18:08.280
You know, I...

18:08.990 --> 18:10.970
I thought that, out of 
everyone in the school,

18:10.970 --> 18:13.800
you were the one I least 
wanted to get involved with.

18:13.800 --> 18:14.740
What?

18:14.740 --> 18:17.600
Why would you say that now?

18:17.600 --> 18:20.610
Because this situation 
is exactly the reason why.

18:20.610 --> 18:22.810
I don't really understand,

18:22.810 --> 18:25.000
but out of everyone in the school,

18:25.000 --> 18:28.000
I thought that you were 
the one I should talk to the most!

18:30.120 --> 18:32.000
Then, here.

18:32.000 --> 18:33.080
Ow!

18:33.080 --> 18:35.590
What are you doing? Wait... huh?

18:35.590 --> 18:37.250
My headache is gone.

18:37.250 --> 18:39.360
Try keeping that on you for a while.

18:39.760 --> 18:41.760
They won't like it, 
so they'll leave you alone.

18:44.760 --> 18:47.900
After that, he started 
patting me on the back more

18:47.900 --> 18:50.890
and telling me not to go out at night.

18:50.890 --> 18:52.510
Why would he do that?

18:53.520 --> 18:56.030
I don't really understand even now.

18:58.910 --> 19:00.390
Miss.

19:03.580 --> 19:06.010
Have you been talking about me?

19:06.010 --> 19:08.490
N-Not really.

19:08.490 --> 19:10.240
Well, I don't mind if you were.

19:10.240 --> 19:11.170
Here.

19:11.170 --> 19:13.510
Another one from my older brother?

19:13.510 --> 19:17.030
If you don't write a proper response, 
he'll come here to get you.

19:17.030 --> 19:18.910
That is definitely possible.

19:18.910 --> 19:20.980
I'll go write a reply.

19:20.980 --> 19:22.270
All right.

19:22.270 --> 19:24.840
It's a letter from her older brother?

19:24.840 --> 19:28.360
Yes. He's also the one who hired me.

19:28.360 --> 19:31.340
He's overprotective, 
just like a certain someone else.

19:32.980 --> 19:34.190
I've finished writing!

19:34.190 --> 19:35.480
That was way too fast.

19:35.480 --> 19:39.820
I made it very clear that there's no need to 
worry and that he should not come here.

19:39.820 --> 19:42.520
Then I'll go into the village and send it.

19:42.520 --> 19:44.890
Oh. Yes, if you would.

19:44.890 --> 19:46.260
Sure thing.

19:50.470 --> 19:51.800
Abel?

19:53.370 --> 19:54.880
What's wrong?

19:54.880 --> 19:56.120
It...

19:56.120 --> 19:59.490
It's a very good thing 
that you and Lawren met!

19:59.490 --> 20:03.560
Because meeting you saved Lawren!

20:04.510 --> 20:06.490
<i>The one who was saved...</i>

20:10.100 --> 20:11.630
Hey, you over there!

20:12.270 --> 20:16.890
If you're on your own, 
would you do this class with me?

20:20.110 --> 20:21.710
If that's what we're talking about,

20:21.710 --> 20:24.900
then it's good that you 
and Lawrence met, Saint Cecilia.

20:25.260 --> 20:26.810
Because, unlike back then,

20:26.810 --> 20:30.790
there's someone else 
I have to look out for now.

20:30.790 --> 20:34.780
Honestly, unlike Lawrence, 
this person is really a handful.

20:34.780 --> 20:36.710
They're overflowing 
with energy to take action.

20:36.710 --> 20:38.240
They never yield on anything.

20:38.240 --> 20:40.500
They keep charging ahead 
until they're satisfied.

20:40.770 --> 20:45.000
And when I say something stupid, 
they pull me along.

20:45.210 --> 20:49.170
This is something you must do, 
not someone else.

20:49.880 --> 20:53.180
Lawrence took my hand 
and pulled me to my feet.

20:53.180 --> 20:58.520
And now, this straight-forward 
person is my guide.

21:00.400 --> 21:02.560
Oh, you're still here?

21:02.560 --> 21:04.520
This is perfect!

21:04.520 --> 21:06.950
I have to buy some things. 
Why don't we all go together?

21:06.950 --> 21:10.460
What? But I was planning 
on taking some side trips.

21:10.460 --> 21:12.990
I thought you might be.

21:13.460 --> 21:16.460
Why did he hire someone like this?

21:16.460 --> 21:18.350
"Someone like this"?

21:18.840 --> 21:21.760
If your expression was still like 
the one in this photo,

21:21.760 --> 21:23.920
we never would have hired you.

21:23.920 --> 21:25.430
No.

21:25.430 --> 21:27.360
I would still have been hired.

21:27.360 --> 21:29.720
That's the sort of 
personality you have, Miss.

21:29.720 --> 21:31.900
What, exactly, do you know about me?

21:31.900 --> 21:33.760
Where you diary is, for example?

21:33.760 --> 21:34.890
What did you just say?

21:34.890 --> 21:35.760
Ooh, scary!

21:35.760 --> 21:37.000
Stop right there!

21:37.000 --> 21:39.630
If you tell me to stop, 
it just makes me want to run away.

21:39.100 --> 21:40.520
Lawren?

21:39.630 --> 21:42.620
I said stop!

21:40.520 --> 21:41.440
Yes, what is it?

21:41.440 --> 21:45.310
It's better when Abel is smiling, isn't it?

21:46.080 --> 21:47.450
Yes, it is.

21:47.800 --> 21:51.490
Compared to back then, I feel much more 
at ease about the way he is now.

23:23.520 --> 23:25.160
Morning, Abel!

23:26.960 --> 23:27.990
Hey!

23:30.720 --> 23:31.920
Morning!

23:32.900 --> 23:34.470
Morning.

23:34.900 --> 23:36.930
Don't skip out today.

23:36.930 --> 23:38.450
Decisions, decisions.

23:38.450 --> 23:39.520
Hey.
